flowchart LR
  P[Solar panel 6V 1.5W] --> C[CN3791 charger + NTC cutoff 0-45C]
  C --> B[18650 3000mAh protected]
  B --> M[ESP32-S3 + LTE]
  M --> CAM[OV2640]
  PIR[PIR] --> M
  ACC[Accelerometer] --> M
  MAG[Compass] --> M
  REED[Reed switch] --> M
  M --> LED[White LED via MOSFET]
  B --> DIV[Divider] --> M
